  | <h1>Grandma&#8217;s &#8220;naïve&#8221; café crème</h1>
  | <p>Serves 4&#8212;6. You&#8217;ll need a 9&#8221; pan (about 23 cm) and a friend who&#8217;s 5&#8216;10&#8221; to reach the top shelf.</p>
  | <p>Whisk &#8216;em together until it&#8217;s &#8220;just right&#8221; &#8212; rock &#8216;n&#8217; roll style.</p>
  | <p>Le chef a dit : « C&#8217;est l&#8217;heure ! » and she said &#8220;Ça va?&#8221; &#8212; yes, ça va.</p>
  | <p>Bake at 180°C for 25&#8212;30 minutes&#8230;</p>
  |
> file recipe.html attr=619
  | <h1>Grandma&rsquo;s &ldquo;naïve&rdquo; café crème</h1>
  | <p>Serves 4&mdash;6. You&rsquo;ll need a 9&rdquo; pan (about 23 cm) and a friend who&rsquo;s 5&lsquo;10&rdquo; to reach the top shelf.</p>
  | <p>Whisk &lsquo;em together until it&rsquo;s &ldquo;just right&rdquo; &mdash; rock &lsquo;n&rsquo; roll style.</p>
  | <p>Le chef a dit : « C&rsquo;est l&rsquo;heure ! » and she said &ldquo;Ça va?&rdquo; &mdash; yes, ça va.</p>
  | <p>Bake at 180°C for 25&mdash;30 minutes&hellip;</p>
  |
> file recipe.html attr=129
  | <h1>Grandma&#8217;s &#8220;naïve&#8221; café crème</h1>
  | <p>Serves 4--6. You&#8217;ll need a 9&#8221; pan (about 23 cm) and a friend who&#8217;s 5&#8216;10&#8221; to reach the top shelf.</p>
  | <p>Whisk &#8216;em together until it&#8217;s &#8220;just right&#8221; -- rock &#8216;n&#8217; roll style.</p>
  | <p>Le chef a dit : « C&#8217;est l&#8217;heure ! » and she said &#8220;Ça va?&#8221; -- yes, ça va.</p>
  | <p>Bake at 180°C for 25--30 minutes...</p>
  |
> file release-notes.html attr=None
  | <h2>Release 4.2 &#8212; &#8220;Larkspur&#8221;</h2>
  | <p>Use the new <code>--dry-run</code> flag to preview changes. Press <kbd>Ctrl-"</kbd> to open the palette.</p>
  | <pre><code>$ deploy --env "staging" --tag 'v4.2'
  | echo "it's done" -- really
  | </code></pre>
  | <p>Upgrading from 3.x? Read the &#8220;Breaking changes&#8221; section first &#8212; it&#8217;s short.</p>
  | <pre>
  |   config['retries'] = 3   # "three" tries
  | </pre>
  | <p>Thanks to everyone who filed bugs in the &#8216;25 beta&#8230; you know who you are.</p>
  |
> file release-notes.html attr=619
